        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>If <span class=\"math\">[MATH: z = 8,]</span> what is the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: z + 11?]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "If [MATH: z = 8,] what is the value of [MATH: z + 11?]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We are given that <span class=\"math\">[MATH: z = 8]</span> and are asked to find the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: z + 11.]</span></p><p>To do this, we substitute <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 8]</span> for <span class=\"math\">[MATH: z]</span> in the expression and simplify:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: z + 11|= 8 + 11; = 19]</span></p><p>So, the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: z + 11]</span> is <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 19.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We are given that [MATH: z = 8] and are asked to find the value of [MATH: z + 11.]\n\nTo do this, we substitute [MATH: 8] for [MATH: z] in the expression and simplify:\n\n[MATH: z + 11|= 8 + 11; = 19]\n\nSo, the value of [MATH: z + 11] is [MATH: 19.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nIf [MATH: z = 8,] what is the value of [MATH: z + 11?]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nWe are given that [MATH: z = 8] and are asked to find the value of [MATH: z + 11.]\n\nTo do this, we substitute [MATH: 8] for [MATH: z] in the expression and simplify:\n\n[MATH: z + 11|= 8 + 11; = 19]\n\nSo, the value of [MATH: z + 11] is [MATH: 19.]"
      },
