            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We are given the equation <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 7x = 63]</span> and are asked to find the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 7x + 6.]</span></p><p>Since we are already told that <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 7x = 63,]</span> we can substitute this value into the expression <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 7x + 6]</span> and simplify:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 7x + 6|= 63 + 6; = 69]</span></p><p>So, the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 7x + 6]</span> is <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 69.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We are given the equation [MATH: 7x = 63] and are asked to find the value of [MATH: 7x + 6.]\n\nSince we are already told that [MATH: 7x = 63,] we can substitute this value into the expression [MATH: 7x + 6] and simplify:\n\n[MATH: 7x + 6|= 63 + 6; = 69]\n\nSo, the value of [MATH: 7x + 6] is [MATH: 69.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
